   "rect": [
    47.97727411443536,
    686.2045503096147,
    240.28408397327766,
    696.2045433738014
   ],
   "fontSize": 9.999993064186697
  },
  {
   "text": "(53). Collectively, these findings underscore the po-",
   "rect": [
    47.97727411443536,
    674.2272678722035,
    240.29544483531603,
    684.22727134011
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000003467906481
  },
  {
   "text": "tential of PCCT to improve respiratory diagnostics,",
   "rect": [
    47.97727411443536,
    662.249995838512,
    240.25000138716263,
    672.2499993064185
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000003467906595
  },
  {
   "text": "particularly emphasizing its ability to depict and",
   "rect": [
    47.97727411443536,
    650.1931769631125,
    240.2272796630859,
    660.1931804310191
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000003467906595
  },
  {
   "text": "quantify airways in the context of chronic obstruc-",
   "rect": [
    47.97727411443536,
    638.215904929421,
    240.30680569735438,
    648.2159083973277
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000003467906708
  },
  {
   "text": "tive pulmonary disease.",
   "rect": [
    47.97727411443536,
    626.2386328957297,
    135.93181956898079,
    636.2386363636363
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000003467906595
  },
  {
   "text": "PCCT for Evaluation of Lung",
   "rect": [
    47.97727411443536,
    604.124995838512,
    181.48863705721766,
    616.1249999999999
   ],
   "fontSize": 12.000004161487936
  },
  {
   "text": "Parenchyma",
   "rect": [
    47.97727411443536,
    592.0795378251509,
    106.4545440673828,
    604.079531582919
   ],
   "fontSize": 11.999993757768152
  },
  {
   "text": "High-spatial-resolution CT is essential to accu-",
   "rect": [
    47.97727411443536,
    578.2613587812943,
    240.23864052512425,
    588.2613622492008
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000003467906481
  },
  {
   "text": "rately diagnose ILDs (54). Given recent advances",
   "rect": [
    47.97727411443536,
    566.2045607133344,
    240.32954822887072,
    576.2045537775213
   ],
   "fontSize": 9.99999306418681
  },
  {
   "text": "in",
   "rect": [
    47.97727411443536,
    554.2386391379615,
    55.761368491432876,
    564.2386322021483
   ],
   "fontSize": 9.99999306418681
  },
  {
   "text": "ILD",
   "rect": [
    62.704540599476196,
    554.2386391379615,
    79.3750034679066,
    564.2386322021483
   ],
   "fontSize": 9.99999306418681
  },
  {
   "text": "therapy,",
   "rect": [
    86.22727827592328,
    554.2386391379615,
    116.57955863259053,
    564.2386322021483
   ],
   "fontSize": 9.99999306418681
  },
  {
   "text": "including",
   "rect": [
    123.45453435724428,
    554.2386391379615,
    159.89771409468216,
    564.2386322021483
   ],
   "fontSize": 9.99999306418681
  },
  {
   "text": "antifibrotic",
   "rect": [
    166.80681402033022,
    554.2386391379615,
    209.29544969038525,
    564.2386322021483
   ],
   "fontSize": 9.99999306418681
  },
  {
   "text": "agents",
   "rect": [
    216.10228105024854,
    554.2386391379615,
    239.90910269997332,
    564.2386322021483
   ],
   "fontSize": 9.99999306418681
  },
  {
   "text": "(55,56), accurate noninvasive diagnosis of ILDs",
   "rect": [
    47.97727411443536,
    542.2613567005503,
    240.32954822887072,
    552.2613497647371
   ],
   "fontSize": 9.99999306418681
  },
  {
   "text": "has become paramount (57). Using CT-pathologic",
   "rect": [
    47.97727411443536,
    530.2840950705788,
    240.29544483531603,
    540.2840881347656
   ],
   "fontSize": 9.99999306418681
  },
  {
   "text": "correlations, patterns of ILDs at CT have been well",
   "rect": [
    47.97727411443536,
    518.2272657914594,
    240.32954822887072,
    528.2272588556463
   ],
   "fontSize": 9.99999306418681
  },
  {
   "text": "studied and described, often obviating the need for",
   "rect": [
    47.97727411443536,
    506.2500041614878,
    240.28408397327766,
    516.2499972256746
   ],
   "fontSize": 9.99999306418681
  },
  {
   "text": "invasive lung biopsy. However, at EID CT, dif-",
   "rect": [
    47.97727411443536,
    494.2727425315163,
    240.29544483531603,
    504.272735595703
   ],
   "fontSize": 9.999993064186697
  },
  {
   "text": "ferentiation of these patterns can be difficult even",
   "rect": [
    47.97727411443536,
    482.2954496903852,
    240.27272311123932,
    492.29545315829176
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000003467906538
  },
  {
   "text": "among ILD experts (58).",
   "rect": [
    47.97727411443536,
    470.25001248446375,
    143.69318181818178,
    480.2500055486505
   ],
   "fontSize": 9.999993064186754
  },
  {
   "text": "PCCT can potentially improve ILD diagnostic",
   "rect": [
    59.97726787220347,
    458.2727300470525,
    240.27273351495913,
    468.27272311123926
   ],
   "fontSize": 9.999993064186754
  },
  {
   "text": "accuracy by increasing the conspicuity of subtle",
   "rect": [
    47.97727411443536,
    446.2954476096413,
    240.25000138716263,
    456.29544067382807
   ],
   "fontSize": 9.999993064186754
  },
  {
   "text": "ILD findings. Several recent studies have found",
   "rect": [
    47.97727411443536,
    434.3181859796697,
    240.32954822887072,
    444.3181790438565
   ],
   "fontSize": 9.99999306418681
  },
  {
   "text": "improved visualization of reticulations, ground-glass opacities,",
   "rect": [
    47.97727411443536,
    422.2613567005504,
    288.38634837757456,
    432.2613497647372
   ],
   "fontSize": 9.99999306418681
  },
  {
   "text": "traction bronchiectasis, and mosaic attenuation for multiple",
   "rect": [
    47.97727411443536,
    410.29544552889735,
    288.3749875155362,
    420.29544899680394
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000003467906595
  },
  {
   "text": "thoracic radiologists (Figs 3, 4) (30,32,33). More importantly,",
   "rect": [
    47.97727411443536,
    398.31819430264557,
    288.4204517711292,
    408.3181873668323
   ],
   "fontSize": 9.999993064186754
  },
  {
   "text": "enhanced visibility and improved confidence in classifying im-",
   "rect": [
    47.97727411443536,
    386.34093267267394,
    288.3977300470525,
    396.34092573686075
   ],
   "fontSize": 9.99999306418681
  },
  {
   "text": "aging abnormalities have led to a reduction of indeterminate",
   "rect": [
    47.97727411443536,
    374.28410339355463,
    288.4204517711292,
    384.28409645774144
   ],
   "fontSize": 9.99999306418681
  },
  {
   "text": "cases (32) and disease reclassification (30). Inoue et al (32) as-",
   "rect": [
    47.97727411443536,
    362.30684176358307,
    288.4318334406072,
    372.3068348277698
   ],
   "fontSize": 9.999993064186754
  },
  {
   "text": "sessed three thoracic radiologists� confidence in evaluating 30",
   "rect": [
    47.97727411443536,
    350.3295385187322,
    288.38634837757456,
    360.329531582919
   ],
   "fontSize": 9.99999306418681
  },
  {
   "text": "patients with suspected ILD using same-day PCCT and EID",
   "rect": [
    47.97727411443536,
    338.3522768887606,
    288.4204517711292,
    348.3522699529474
   ],
   "fontSize": 9.999993064186754
  },
  {
   "text": "CT and found a lower number of patients classified as hav-",
   "rect": [
    47.97727411443536,
    326.30679806795985,
    288.38634837757456,
    336.30680153586644
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000003467906595
  },
  {
   "text": "ing indeterminate usual interstitial pneumonia and a higher",
   "rect": [
    47.97727411443536,
    314.3295364379882,
    288.3977300470525,
    324.3295399058948
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000003467906595
  },
  {
   "text": "number of patients with probable usual interstitial pneumonia",
   "rect": [
    47.97727411443536,
    302.3522852117365,
    288.38634837757456,
    312.35227827592325
   ],
   "fontSize": 9.999993064186754
  },
  {
   "text": "at PCCT. Gaillandre et al (30) compared baseline dual-source",
   "rect": [
    47.97727411443536,
    290.3750235817648,
    288.4204517711292,
    300.37501664595163
   ],
   "fontSize": 9.99999306418681
  },
  {
   "text": "EID CT with dual-source PCCT at 10�23-month follow-up",
   "rect": [
    47.97727411443536,
    278.31819430264557,
    288.4999986128373,
    288.3181873668324
   ],
   "fontSize": 9.99999306418681
  },
  {
   "text": "in 112 patients with stable ILD. In addition to PCCT demon-",
   "rect": [
    47.97727411443536,
    266.34093267267394,
    288.38634837757456,
    276.34092573686075
   ],
   "fontSize": 9.99999306418681
  },
  {
   "text": "strating significantly improved visualization of micronodules,",
   "rect": [
    47.97727411443536,
    254.37497988614163,
    288.38634837757456,
    264.37498335404825
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000003467906623
  },
  {
   "text": "linear opacities, intralobular reticulation, bronchiectasis, bron-",
   "rect": [
    47.97727411443536,
    242.39771825617007,
    288.44319430264557,
    252.39772172407672
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000003467906652
  },
  {
   "text": "chiolectasis, and honeycombing, the authors reported reclas-",
   "rect": [
    47.97727411443536,
    230.3408889770507,
    288.44319430264557,
    240.34089244495735
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000003467906652
  },
  {
   "text": "sification of four patients from nonfibrotic to fibrotic ILD.",
   "rect": [
    47.97727411443536,
    218.36362734707916,
    288.4204517711292,
    228.36363081498578
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000003467906623
  },
  {
   "text": "PCCT improved feature visualization despite a 27% lower ra-",
   "rect": [
    47.97727411443536,
    206.3863761208274,
    288.44319430264557,
    216.38636918501422
   ],
   "fontSize": 9.99999306418681
  },
  {
   "text": "diation dose. In 61 patients with rheumatoid arthritis�related",
   "rect": [
    47.97727411443536,
    194.40911449085576,
    288.3977300470525,
    204.40910755504257
   ],
   "fontSize": 9.99999306418681
  },
  {
   "text": "ILD, Marton et al (33) found that ultrahigh-spatial-resolution",
   "rect": [
    47.97727411443536,
    182.36363567005498,
    288.4545551646839,
    192.36363913796163
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000003467906652
  },
  {
   "text": "PCCT at 0.2-mm section thickness (using routine radiation dose)",
   "rect": [
    47.97727411443536,
    170.3863740400834,
    288.4090909090909,
    180.38637750799006
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000003467906652
  },
  {
   "text": "displayed reticulation and bronchiectasis (but not ground-glass",
   "rect": [
    47.97727411443536,
    158.40907079523254,
    288.38634837757456,
    168.4090742631392
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000003467906652
  },
  {
   "text": "opacities and honeycombing) better than routine-resolution",
   "rect": [
    47.97727411443536,
    146.43180916526097,
    288.4204517711292,
    156.43181263316762
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000003467906652
  },
  {
   "text": "but low-radiation-dose PCCT at 0.4-mm section thickness.",
   "rect": [
    47.97727411443536,
    134.37497988614172,
    278.03410616787994,
    144.37498335404825
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000003467906538
  },
  {
   "text": "In addition to improving conventional ILD imaging, PCCT",
   "rect": [
    59.97726787220347,
    122.39771825617005,
    288.40908050537104,
    132.3977217240767
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000003467906637
  },
  {
   "text": "may also enhance visualization of post�COVID-19 lung ab-",
   "rect": [
    47.97727411443536,
    110.4318174882368,
    288.46591602672225,
    120.43182095614344
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000003467906637
  },
  {
   "text": "normalities. Prayer et al (34) studied 20 patients with post�",
   "rect": [
    47.97727411443536,
    98.37498820911755,
    288.38634837757456,
    108.37499167702418
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000003467906637
  },
  {
   "text": "COVID-19 symptoms with same-day PCCT (1.0-, 0.4-, and",
   "rect": [
    47.97727411443536,
    86.39772657914598,
    288.46591602672225,
    96.39773004705252
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000003467906538
  },
  {
   "text": "0.2-mm section thicknesses) and EID CT (1.0-mm section",
   "rect": [
    47.97727411443536,
    74.42042333429511,
    288.44319430264557,
    84.42042680220175
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000003467906637
  },
  {
   "text": "thickness) and demonstrated that PCCT revealed additional",
   "rect": [
    47.97727411443536,
    62.44316170432355,
    288.3977300470525,
    72.44316517223008
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.00000346790653
  },
  {
   "text": "lung abnormalities in 50%. The most frequent additional",
   "rect": [
    47.97727411443536,
    50.38633242520418,
    288.4204517711292,
    60.38633589311082
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000003467906637
  },
  {
   "text": "lung abnormalities detected with PCCT were bronchiolectasis",
   "rect": [
    305.9545482288707,
    422.57953366366297,
    546.3977258855646,
    432.57953713156957
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000003467906595
  },
  {
   "text": "and reticulations (in 50% and 35% of patients, respectively).",
   "rect": [
    305.9545482288707,
    410.60227203369135,
    546.3863650235262,
    420.60227550159794
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000003467906595
  },
  {
   "text": "Fine reticulations were observed at PCCT in areas classified as",
   "rect": [
    305.9545482288707,
    398.6250104037197,
    546.3636224920099,
    408.6250138716264
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000003467906652
  },
  {
   "text": "ground-glass opacities at EID CT in 30% of patients.",
   "rect": [
    305.9545482288707,
    386.5681811246004,
    507.73864746093744,
    396.56818459250707
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000003467906652
  },
  {
   "text": "Jungblut et al (35) performed an important study addressing",
   "rect": [
    317.95453158291895,
    374.6022803566672,
    546.3522616299715,
    384.6022838245738
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000003467906595
  },
  {
   "text": "the ability of PCCT to diagnose ILD at lower radiation doses.",
   "rect": [
    305.9545482288707,
    362.6250187266956,
    546.3636224920099,
    372.6250221946022
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000003467906595
  },
  {
   "text": "They compared dual-source EID CT at baseline with PCCT at",
   "rect": [
    305.9545482288707,
    350.6477154818448,
    546.454551003196,
    360.6477189497514
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000003467906595
  },
  {
   "text": "follow-up. Single-tube image reconstruction was used to pro-",
   "rect": [
    305.9545482288707,
    338.59092781760467,
    546.3977258855646,
    348.5909312855113
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000003467906652
  },
  {
   "text": "duce EID CT images at 33% and 66% of the original dose.",
   "rect": [
    305.9545482288707,
    326.61362457275385,
    546.4090867476028,
    336.61362804066044
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000003467906595
  },
  {
   "text": "The radiation dose of PCCT was similar to the 33% CT image,",
   "rect": [
    305.9545482288707,
    314.6363629427822,
    546.4204684170809,
    324.6363664106889
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000003467906652
  },
  {
   "text": "but the image noise, image quality, and diagnostic accuracy were",
   "rect": [
    305.9545482288707,
    302.67046217484904,
    546.4204684170809,
    312.67046564275563
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000003467906595
  },
  {
   "text": "similar compared with full-dose EID CT in 80 patients with",
   "rect": [
    305.9545482288707,
    290.61363289572967,
    546.3522616299715,
    300.6136363636363
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000003467906652
  },
  {
   "text": "systemic sclerosis. This is important in the setting of recurring",
   "rect": [
    305.9545482288707,
    278.63637126575816,
    546.3295399058948,
    288.63637473366475
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000003467906595
  },
  {
   "text": "CT follow-up for patients with ILD and is in harmony with",
   "rect": [
    305.9545482288707,
    266.6591096357866,
    546.4090867476028,
    276.65911310369313
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000003467906538
  },
  {
   "text": "previously cited studies (30,32).",
   "rect": [
    305.9545482288707,
    254.6818063909357,
    426.03409507057876,
    264.6818098588423
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000003467906623
  },
  {
